\title{nbzinbKnight: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression}
\description{
Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the coefficients, alternated with Newton-Raphson updates for the dispersion parameter theta. Fits zero-inflated negative binomial regression by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. Results are checked against MASS::glm.nb() and pscl::zeroinfl(). Developed as the STA 651 final project.
